main idea: git/github duolingo learning type website app

3 main units:

1. github fundamentals: 
- git vs github (what each is for)
- setting up git (machine dependant)
- main git cmd's (machine dependant)
- git integration with projects

2. github advanced
- github for students 
- merge, pull requests, branches
- collaboration
- undoing mistakes (restore, revert)

3. github theory
- version control - snapshots - hashes
- git as a database
- The 3 areas (working directory → staging area → repository)
- Centralized vs distributed (one shared server vs everyone having the full history)